#: includes/views/redirects-page.php:60
msgid ""
"What this means: your web server (or a CDN in front of it) answers requests "
"for missing image files itself, so the plugin never gets the chance to "
"redirect old image URLs after a rename. Content on your own site keeps "
"working — the plugin rewrites those references — but external links, embeds "
"and image search results pointing at old URLs get an error. Ask your host to"
" route missing files under wp-content/uploads through WordPress, or add "
"server-level redirect rules for renamed images."
msgstr ""
"Wat dit betsjut: jo webserver (of in CDN derfoar) beantwurdet sels oanfragen"
" foar ûntbrekkende ôfbyldingsbestannen, sadat de plugin nea de kâns krijt om"
" âlde ôfbylding URLs nei in werneam te trochferwizen. Ynhâld op jo eigen "
"side bliuwt wurkjen - de plugin herskriuwt dy referinsjes - mar eksterne "
"keppelings, ynbêdingen en ôfbyldingssykresultaten dy't nei âlde URLs wize "
"krije in flater. Freegje jo host om ûntbrekkende bestannen ûnder wp-"
"content/uploads troch WordPress te rûte, of foegje server-nivo "
"trochferwizingsregels ta foar werneamde ôfbyldings."

